'''Harvester''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier in the Main Event for 80,000 [[Candies (2021)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2021}} during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Harvester resembles a crossbow. It has a unique shoot line, which is emerald green. The arrow itself is green as well, and the rest of the crossbow is made of dark stone and steel.

==Trivia==
*It is the first [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] gun in the game, the second being [[Icepiercer]], the third being [[Gingerscope]], and the fourth being [[Emberbow]].
*This, [[Icepiercer]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Raygun]], [[Chroma Raygun]], [[Snowcannon]], and [[Chroma Snowcannon]] are the only guns in [[Murder Mystery 2]] to have a unique shooting sound effect.
*It is also the first gun in Murder Mystery 2 to resemble a Crossbow, along with [[Icepiercer]] and [[Emberbow]].
*It costed 97,400 [[Candies (2021)|candies]] {{Currency|Candies2021}} in total to get to the final tier and buy Harvester, which is about 6,000 Robux worth of candies to buy (about $75 USD).
* It costed the same amount of [[Candies (2021)|candies]] {{Currency|Candies2021}} as the [[Elderwood Scythe]].
* It was a targeted victim of [[The Candleflame Glitch (2021)]], causing [[Nikilis]] to ban people with large amounts of this item.
*Harvester has different leaderboard variants in [[Blue Harvester|blue]], [[Bronze Harvester|bronze]], [[Silver Harvester|silver]], and [[Gold Harvester|gold]], which were awarded as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Trophy Items|trophy Items]] for getting on the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Halloween_Event_2021#Leaderboards 2021 Halloween Leaderboard].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

